cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these skills, please cite them as below. Cite the data sources named in each skill for any value you use."
type: software
title: "Environment data for on-farm trials and breeding. AI agent skills for weather, elevation, soil, boundaries and climate hazards at points"
abstract: >-
  Agent skills that fetch daily weather (CHIRPS, CHIRTS, AgERA5), elevation, soil,
  administrative boundaries and climate hazards for sets of points such as
  farms, trial sites and survey households, with the Python scripts behind
  them. Built for breeders and climate scientists working with tricot trials
  or on their own. Part of the AgrDataSci ai-ready-documentation suite.
version: "0.1.0"
